sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Objecter (client)
  participant O as OSD (primary)
  C->>O: MOSDOp on PG 3.15 (epoch 812)
  O->>O: PG peering or object unfound
  O->>C: MOSDBackoff BLOCK [begin,end) id=7
  C->>O: MOSDBackoff ACK_BLOCK
  C->>C: hold the ops for this range in the session
  O->>O: PG becomes active
  O->>C: MOSDBackoff UNBLOCK id=7
  C->>O: resend the held ops
  O-->>C: MOSDOpReply
